    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0011": {
      "value": "你的想法不是商品。Inner Thought 让你捕捉的内在世界始终由你掌控。",
      "sourceSha256": "28e7d8519b81fe16000ab67d5ce524aa1d568ede8e2efff8c7e8e36e61146243"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0012": {
      "value": "简单来说：",
      "sourceSha256": "fb3329ada8900b811d5a90803c261195b66db525684c23faa14914e53c147a94"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0013": {
      "value": "无账户、无广告、无第三方分析、不出售数据，也没有 Moving Truth 运营的云服务。",
      "sourceSha256": "203e580cafd769beea889525196a4fe1168eafb3a7d51e77a5424f1c3e016160"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0014": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 存储什么",
      "sourceSha256": "afd76c04fe44ab8e068c329c69caf93e59cfe5914c69ec43241f1f3d6d0b4a63"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0015": {
      "value": "只存储你选择创建的内容：标题、键入或听写的文字、语音录音、可选的一次性位置、标签、照片、视频、收藏，以及整理或恢复想法所需的日期。",
      "sourceSha256": "2599051440e0c9851bc4a2b4da2b4874c0a21f0eaca6a4727bddb0756fe3678f"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0016": {
      "value": "位置绝不会成为行动轨迹。只有当你为某次捕捉启用位置时，Inner Thought 才请求一个位置点。",
      "sourceSha256": "1d6271e6ec01d83b21fd0dbf069cd44be64da8f66cdd27b68ce0bb4308de3321"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0017": {
      "value": "如何保护你的想法",
      "sourceSha256": "deae090bef87448892ef7a3754689358eba4547cc59788990adbd1165d77b098"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0018": {
      "value": "保存的标题、文字稿、位置详情、自定义标签名、录音引用、媒体描述、音频、照片和视频都在设备上加密。Inner Thought 使用 AES-256-GCM 认证加密，密钥保存在 iOS Keychain。",
      "sourceSha256": "d92c0751946471d52ffaa57d3568f0701ce3a681c3f6ae84ec47afc3e0ac1720"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0019": {
      "value": "大型录音和视频按认证分块加密。播放、查看、导出或分享时，应用可能创建受 iOS 完整文件保护的短期明文副本。应用离开前台或进行存储维护时，这些工作副本会被删除。",
      "sourceSha256": "69da5ab8e69b523ac6b5bafc97693093a29dc9ed14d2fe2b95e0231d48af4e63"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0020": {
      "value": "录音进行时，Apple 音频系统写入的内容必须短暂存在于受 iOS 保护的工作文件中。想法保存后会立即加密。",
      "sourceSha256": "621395d84ef48f42b0b56b3385b30a1bed2f8c667861747115aeab2feb6a9836"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0021": {
      "value": "权限由你选择",
      "sourceSha256": "d810c266485273ed27867e80dfedfa2357145f0808e92cdf714151383c35400e"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0022": {
      "value": "麦克风与转录",
      "sourceSha256": "c0b5612806df11ef7715995c5dc9e20a2c65cd713e0acf90c5448ed2e0f1f30c"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0023": {
      "value": "仅在录音或听写时使用麦克风。实时转录要求使用 Apple 的设备端语音识别。你可以全局关闭转录，也可以为单条语音想法关闭。",
      "sourceSha256": "53a1be370adb40f67b529654cd561e1e8e9631d5e83dcbbe977aa73243aa451f"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0024": {
      "value": "位置",
      "sourceSha256": "15b61974b2707a7b3d4201385e0f01f4ff5eb1f17c5639d98788ee5add2025cd"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0025": {
      "value": "位置可选，可逐条想法更改，也可在 Settings 中关闭。Inner Thought 不会在后台追踪你。",
      "sourceSha256": "f7092f0dc4d21539d9b9621a15585f23aebfcedf374e0e498a4534efdfde8323"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0026": {
      "value": "照片与相机",
      "sourceSha256": "5f30103c80199e6da86be9da99a41542b5701c88bb0f5ca46b335bf277541b3e"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0027": {
      "value": "系统照片选择器允许你挑选特定项目，而无需授予 Inner Thought 对图库的广泛访问。只有打开相机时才使用相机权限。新媒体默认留在 Inner Thought 内；只有你选择时，副本才会添加到 Photos。",
      "sourceSha256": "8543895ed7ade4c866498ade59c003cf647721c821bd6f1684c8f3bf9d53d403"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0028": {
      "value": "分享与导出",
      "sourceSha256": "9e5a4a9e0f30637b305e72c06528c82384651d2f894965181121ccb3e98acfcf"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0029": {
      "value": "不会向 Moving Truth 发送任何内容。使用 Share、Save to Photos、电子邮件或其他导出目的地时，是你选择向该目的地提供解密副本；之后适用该目的地的隐私规则。",
      "sourceSha256": "18d324809509f30a32e3c3deb68d3a36108b4b94ab45e6c54a3ae1acd65ea6db"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0030": {
      "value": "分析、广告与账户",
      "sourceSha256": "6e90d2c7c7e7d161bb42a723133e5761fc1eaeadd03d5bfa8318b6bcbded31c4"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0031": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 没有用户账户、应用内广告、追踪 SDK 或第三方分析。诊断日志不会包含想法文字、文字稿、文件名或坐标。",
      "sourceSha256": "950ab66e12f7e8dcc95e8928c5e2eccf8bfcf8eeb3505a706b9c942e066e8a0c"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0032": {
      "value": "删除与保留",
      "sourceSha256": "b36c8ce6b02f45535ac757b4eba1e440ae9ecaaa126490ec2703e0965908e01f"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0033": {
      "value": "删除的想法会在 Recently Deleted 中保留 30 天，以便恢复。永久删除或 30 天到期后，会移除数据库记录及受管理的音频、照片与视频文件。设备备份由你在 Apple 设置的备份选择与保护方式决定。",
      "sourceSha256": "096e882b061c0e0e4a8ddcd155d573c28b880b03a1dc845b74a70bc1c100921d"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0034": {
      "value": "儿童隐私",
      "sourceSha256": "740155cb51d893d9714ebf29691abe68055cb9a3d33f41df4af6d570b7634f67"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0035": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 不会有意收集任何人的个人信息，包括儿童，因为 Moving Truth 不为应用运营账户、分析、广告或内容收集服务。",
      "sourceSha256": "fd7fb3f554559d20cad6fb6426f8e31b494e50532051a58512593e7cbe075c4b"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0036": {
      "value": "政策变更",
      "sourceSha256": "86cb08a84ff4d12d0d7e1741c28362b6c4923971cd8eb2b4bf0b7a9e5277534f"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0037": {
      "value": "如果 Inner Thought 的数据做法改变，本页会在新行为发布前更新。重大变化会清楚说明，而不会藏在法律文字中。",
      "sourceSha256": "972c141fb0957bc901691b6bd7b1387ceb321f1dfba261b0c93401d5907263cd"
    },
    "inner-thought.privacy-policy.text.0038": {
