    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0009": {
      "value": "以人为先",
      "sourceSha256": "5b4f83fad5351a96eec969e4432b2a69d920d2e0d5742025d353b8f763e3934e"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0010": {
      "value": "无障碍",
      "sourceSha256": "d3368cbffe23c98da887d279a1b5c74b7618ba5c0488cbed30cf304f8f9398a1"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0011": {
      "value": "只有一个 Inner Thought，不分无障碍版和默认版。能否使用是这项承诺是否真实的一部分。",
      "sourceSha256": "4ede492487faf0eab8c9aecc8e3a0733c88359019897c205b8ccdd339230462b"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0012": {
      "value": "我们的标准：",
      "sourceSha256": "0e64506db1c7683c9d308cc3a87238a5de38dec5fae890562d8ab77c6c3e669c"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0013": {
      "value": "控件有标签并不代表功能已经完成。只有当一个人能用自己依赖的辅助方式理解并完成整项任务时，它才算完成。",
      "sourceSha256": "dd24f66cc1341d769d382fb7e6cebeef27ad635ffdb1f168f5015bcda6992d56"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0014": {
      "value": "围绕不同互动方式设计",
      "sourceSha256": "1eae579a7d9838a1a7eeddb474951ec44f1b1a0481c0bfa2da1b9819731c831f"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0015": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 支持 VoiceOver、Voice Control、Switch Control、硬件键盘、Larger Text、Bold Text、Increase Contrast、Differentiate Without Color、Reduce Motion，以及浅色与深色外观。",
      "sourceSha256": "74e357b51792194c326d2538c17dbc4660010c74a589ce419522257abe1043a1"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0016": {
      "value": "录音、播放、保存、错误和位置状态绝不会只靠颜色、声音、运动或触觉表达。手势是快捷方式，而不是唯一途径。",
      "sourceSha256": "bbf762cb51222f75dc01b06cc706005f9ac08a3fb33be1331aebdc62acdacb62"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0017": {
      "value": "文字始终是内容",
      "sourceSha256": "9b1a239e4ec8a299508551528fb4a6c7c13f0bc62d4180e447807b189c8cad3b"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0018": {
      "value": "文字使用 Dynamic Type；布局会随内容扩展，而不是隐藏关键操作。语音控件使用本地化名称和值。实时转录可选；语音识别不可用时，录音仍会安全保存。",
      "sourceSha256": "5ce97173cc824c088f210a32e110309baba4abf0a6e32f37cb51b5348d10a75e"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0019": {
      "value": "照片与视频可添加由用户提供的描述。播放界面会显示已用时间和总时长，并提供可调进度控制。",
      "sourceSha256": "141236135d21c802a6556469b7e88ca536623cac357267aac9f3083896080311"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0020": {
      "value": "运动、对比度与注意力",
      "sourceSha256": "1d9f454f3f80509a3924bce206d4f99995fa62a829d98297029ffc165c835a0e"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0021": {
      "value": "Reduce Motion 提供完整而稳定的静态体验。重要状态除颜色外还使用文字和形状，界面会响应更强对比度与无颜色区分设置。不必要的氛围动态会暂停。",
      "sourceSha256": "a9370a5b43c854442cb8989330125bfb4430b53819f7d4de62c3d727a96b71e5"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0022": {
      "value": "我们如何确认一个版本合格",
      "sourceSha256": "2ad2a6f772f3daaee77a52fe1ede6209240c259121bc859877cb27d281347fdf"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0023": {
      "value": "自动检查涵盖放大文字、刻意加长的文案、阿拉伯语从右到左布局、所有支持的界面语言，以及 iPhone 和 iPad 上的主要导航。随后在实体设备上测试辅助技术、录音、权限、小组件与 Live Activities 的完整任务。",
      "sourceSha256": "10f7761355dc694602cb37e0b2552e8d42d8c55db8d22a2c967a1b6be3b73c6f"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0024": {
      "value": "只有在 Apple 标准所列的每项常用任务都针对相应设备系列完成验证后，我们才会发布 App Store 无障碍标签。宁可不发布声明，也不夸大尚未证明的能力。",
      "sourceSha256": "69f307857a25d6fa055b677b5430a562189075775dda22a5005401091ecdf9df"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0025": {
      "value": "告诉我们哪里阻碍了使用",
      "sourceSha256": "4d0b87e904dd32d34e91a432a3affcdc3664927b4b126d5c80b54af0426b4965"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0026": {
      "value": "无障碍失败就是产品失败。如果有任何问题阻碍你捕捉、查找、阅读、聆听、编辑、导出或删除想法，请发送邮件至",
      "sourceSha256": "e2a4c8e4d558cb85fe3e051bda22a08064132825f724834d08792e7e8a5b3a01"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0027": {
      "value": "。请说明设备、iOS 或 iPadOS 版本、辅助功能和任务。除非你明确希望我们看到，否则不要附上私密想法。",
      "sourceSha256": "427838a4a7c1e2fc02ee90f9d2c632d196974236b7768ea3d3b5ccaaf200aa11"
    },
    "inner-thought.accessibility.text.0028": {
      "value": "主页",
      "sourceSha256": "3a78695388b38b5cceefaf6796b0137877514593543b91af2752d5a17e3d736c"
    },
