      "value": "支持",
      "sourceSha256": "be91940b79f469101df9a50544b6873aa5509a12f1f93f1cb5e3be3990d344b3"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0008": {
      "value": "技术工艺",
      "sourceSha256": "ed7b84a2eb484c5b73f39e114cd551a47e8e1b764b945ccfaa1c98280fc3439b"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0009": {
      "value": "所有应用",
      "sourceSha256": "01bed311e7d0c963a5f8afe3dd3c99c8140d887d92c602b94b9309fa51b32723"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0010": {
      "value": "原生构建。刻意创作的。",
      "sourceSha256": "2d06a2ec23c6b4b91864a07beb575ad6959b78483188674038f7f071699cf659"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0011": {
      "value": "技术工艺",
      "sourceSha256": "ed7b84a2eb484c5b73f39e114cd551a47e8e1b764b945ccfaa1c98280fc3439b"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0012": {
      "value": "对于那些好奇平静之下的工作的人来说，Inner Thought 是这样制作的：苹果原生框架，清晰的边界，可恢复的状态，以及对使用它的整个人的关怀。",
      "sourceSha256": "06a7f3d4e68b576d92732de44ef16e19d796e17d607f8a0559a5d5b655b4e83a"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0013": {
      "value": "原生设计",
      "sourceSha256": "025f6a9359f5cf5490690f057d9dc62fbcf59ebb98970452e8f272348a43c1d4"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0014": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 是用 Swift 和 SwiftUI 编写的，使用 SwiftData、AVFoundation、Speech、MapKit、PhotosUI、WidgetKit、ActivityKit、App Intents、CryptoKit 和 LocalAuthentication。 Apple 原生框架使应用程序与平台保持紧密联系，默认情况下是私有的，并且依赖较少。",
      "sourceSha256": "ecfcc54ddad7693e41f7f7763651f68e99d2006f1a08fc2b4d8eb3c2068e965b"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0015": {
      "value": "小而集中的职责",
      "sourceSha256": "0295714bf22c45d23a8814732ec2358d2604853872ffdd0988df561d89a4fa26"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0016": {
      "value": "接口表达状态；集中控制器和服务拥有录音、转录、存储、播放、媒体、位置、加密和系统演示。共享协调器连接这些部分，而不需要让屏幕负责所有事情。",
      "sourceSha256": "ce605123ff13e9bbbef07aa9dd4502159632042f1a3020d7c415545dbef6a5ac"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0017": {
      "value": "思想为先",
      "sourceSha256": "c4d083d63d69e39646b8ba58f719d16ea075977f82ff81f0d4414370b7432c4a"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0018": {
      "value": "音频是权威的，其目的地在捕获开始之前就存在。暂停、中断、转录失败和存储错误被设计为可恢复状态。有效的录音永远不会因为语音识别失败而被丢弃。",
      "sourceSha256": "1428a99e7c1306247eeee0b4852bf2ad788cbd6fc87974073f1652684ff31463"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0019": {
      "value": "结构私有",
      "sourceSha256": "22fd7b42a3583a9e98aba945ffe50311b21ce5c603743236e0bbb725db5aebd9"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0020": {
      "value": "标题、文字记录、位置、自定义标签、音频、照片和视频均使用 AES-256-GCM 加密。钥匙位于 iOS 钥匙串中；解密的工作文件使用平台文件保护，并在应用程序离开前台时被清除。没有帐户、广告、跟踪器或第三方分析。",
      "sourceSha256": "50cf8bf868693f773af89f9015bd50ca77db4022b9b2b898de289dc2dfb12f11"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0021": {
      "value": "一个应用程序，多种方式",
      "sourceSha256": "6c2987ec157dc878bef005a22bd76b7241f2ed5325c4fc3ddce8e21eadd760dd"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0022": {
      "value": "语义控制、动态类型、VoiceOver、语音控制、开关控制、键盘访问、减少动作、增加对比度和非颜色提示均在整个任务中考虑。可访问性被评估为某人可以完成的路径，而不是修饰符的数量。",
      "sourceSha256": "f2a84810ec40bb52a980e8ff44f6b2793d2b61fa5d47b26d0c0d920004ecbe30"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0023": {
      "value": "以人为本",
      "sourceSha256": "5b4f83fad5351a96eec969e4432b2a69d920d2e0d5742025d353b8f763e3934e"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0024": {
      "value": "Apple 的人机界面指南和辅助功能原则指导我们将人（而不是功能）置于每个决策的中心。 Inner Thought 考虑有视觉、听觉、行动能力、言语和认知障碍的人，以及暂时和情境限制。意义从来不只依赖于颜色、动作、声音或手势；增强功能仍然是可选的；隐私和尊严得到保护。自动证据支持这项工作，并发布声明等待物理辅助技术验证。",
      "sourceSha256": "09954e9f9cf1a48bfa71d76252ac307112bbc544bc56f47474f8fe384e622991"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0025": {
      "value": "建筑中的语言",
      "sourceSha256": "4e22fc997ce11765697d9ff8a17972019e7db5b14cf4ee1d3cef498bef8e1113"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0026": {
      "value": "每个可见和口头的界面字符串都位于字符串目录中。布局是双向的，用户创作的单词保持其语言，日期、时间和数字遵循活动区域设置。内置十四种启动语言；翻译草稿在发布前仍需要经过流畅的人工审核。",
      "sourceSha256": "6271558bbc0fd84c255bed48929ac8c648a81c9204b7b2ba93c9a9119f750cbf"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0027": {
      "value": "应用程序之外的原生",
      "sourceSha256": "9bde744943c3ce21d087cae665744616d6fedb1dddbae6a0d524ac99674b8144"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0028": {
      "value": "主屏幕和锁屏小部件、实时活动、动态岛和应用程序意图共享一个特意小的命令层和捕获协调器。私人思想文本远离系统表面；只有控制活动捕获所需的状态才会离开应用程序界面。",
      "sourceSha256": "13317985baaaa892e6fbdf4fa62d35aba83f5e3ec5e29d628e8e75cd538d25eb"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0029": {
      "value": "证据，而非信心",
      "sourceSha256": "1fab7bb5cb4d67127ed654d8c6afdbd8079748238acdaf8ff369d92e1931facd"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0030": {
      "value": "确定性单元测试练习持久性、加密、恢复、媒体、映射和捕获状态。 UI 测试涵盖导航、扩展文本和从右到左布局。自动化检查支持工作；实体 iPhone 和辅助技术测试仍处于发布阶段。",
      "sourceSha256": "2fa1f74972451a7855d8ac94679268420cc0edc7d15fee03bf82f72f0b530661"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0031": {
      "value": "工程服务平静",
      "sourceSha256": "b75cd8fb45d52c793bd8fcd107d101102992dc5c708ebed02bef2f8dd3281be5"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0032": {
      "value": "最后恩典并没有被涂在功能上。渐进式的披露、语义排版、稳定的布局空间、受限的运动和安静的材料让实质性的功能保持平静和易于理解。",
      "sourceSha256": "15a009d9533bd3f75a77b5e75c80587dd63c4f01128bcb1d0a57d4861dda89eb"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0033": {
      "value": "结果应该让人感觉简单，因为复杂性已经被小心地隐藏在下面。",
      "sourceSha256": "c6ab85229e334e4a21de7f828211d60f8a871dee3581b8c664e7e37b3eeef256"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0034": {
      "value": "主页",
      "sourceSha256": "3a78695388b38b5cceefaf6796b0137877514593543b91af2752d5a17e3d736c"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0035": {
      "value": "隐私",
      "sourceSha256": "54a57c3147c49f33de5898b87084ad2b14c4ab308f762454bf92aca907478ad5"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0036": {
      "value": "无障碍",
      "sourceSha256": "d3368cbffe23c98da887d279a1b5c74b7618ba5c0488cbed30cf304f8f9398a1"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0037": {
      "value": "支持",
      "sourceSha256": "be91940b79f469101df9a50544b6873aa5509a12f1f93f1cb5e3be3990d344b3"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0038": {
      "value": "技术工艺",
      "sourceSha256": "ed7b84a2eb484c5b73f39e114cd551a47e8e1b764b945ccfaa1c98280fc3439b"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0039": {
      "value": "所有应用",
      "sourceSha256": "01bed311e7d0c963a5f8afe3dd3c99c8140d887d92c602b94b9309fa51b32723"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.text.0040": {
      "value": "© 2026 Inner Thought，Moving Truth 出品。",
      "sourceSha256": "9027597546fb0a235f37f5b2aa53c4b68e303520c01fdbac2ee9a7f1a8abd76f"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.attribute.0001": {
      "value": "对于那些好奇平静之下的工作的人来说，Inner Thought 是这样制作的：苹果原生框架，清晰的边界，可恢复的状态，以及对使用它的整个人的关怀。",
      "sourceSha256": "06a7f3d4e68b576d92732de44ef16e19d796e17d607f8a0559a5d5b655b4e83a"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.attribute.0002": {
      "value": "Inner Thought 主页",
      "sourceSha256": "23d91187961439354f1e8399a6d26c7d146b7ff0437fe3b71aea38babfdfed01"
    },
    "inner-thought.technical-craft.attribute.0003": {
